{
  "_comment": "What the object spotter looks for. Each LABEL (what is shown on screen) is described to the model by one or more PROMPTS (plain words; the model matches each object against all of them and the label takes its best-matching prompt). 'show': false labels are still detected, so the object does not get mislabelled as something else, but are never drawn. Edit this, then rebuild: .venv\\Scripts\\python.exe -m backend.objects.build",
